  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has formally communicated the nomination of two candidates for the office of vice president to the People's Consultative Assembly, or MPR, of Indonesia. This development follows recent political discourse surrounding the replacement of Gibran Rakabuming Raka. Among the candidates reported in media coverage is Minister of Agriculture Andi Amran Sulaiman. Prior to this official submission, various public figures and academics had publicly expressed support for Sufmi Dasco for the role, citing his experience, policy execution capabilities, and his professional relationship with the president. President Prabowo has emphasized that the selection of the two candidates for the wapres position was conducted through a democratic process based on his own decision-making. The transition follows ongoing administrative discussions within the government regarding leadership roles.",
